  "bodyHash": "5d877bb81b7e68ac",
  "content": "\n\n<p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=000000&color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=000000&color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=000000&color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveAircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Github\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Translate via Crowdin\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=crowdin&color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p>\n<p>\n本模组添加了一系列复古风格的飞行器，助你旅行、运输与探索！\n这些飞行器在设计上高度忠于原版，包含丰富的细节与功能，同时操作并不复杂。\n</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/atlas?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=_immersive_aircraft:aircraft&dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveAircraft/tree/1.20.1?&c=1&resolution=48&background=fancy&row_size=10\" alt=\"Generated Atlas Image\"></p>\n<p>哦对了，它支持多人联机！</p>\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/screen1.jpg\" alt=\"Screenshot\"></p>\n<h1>双翼飞机</h1>\n<p>先从经典的双翼飞机开始吧。速度快，单座，难度中等。</p>\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/biplane.jpg\" alt=\"Screenshot\"></p>\n<h1>飞艇</h1>\n<p>速度较慢，但拥有两个座位。非常易于操控，得益于尾部的引擎，速度也尚可。此外还有更笨重的货运版本！</p>\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/airship.jpg\" alt=\"Screenshot\"></p>\n<h1>自转旋翼机</h1>\n<p>人力驱动的原始双座飞行器。可靠耐用，但既不是最快的也不是最容易驾驶的。需要较大的初始推力才能让旋翼转动起来。</p>\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/gyrodyne.jpg\" alt=\"Screenshot\"></p>\n<h1>四轴飞行器</h1>\n<p>工程学的杰作！四个螺旋桨绑在一捆竹子上。建造时非常方便。</p>\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/quadrocopter.jpg\" alt=\"Screenshot\"></p>\n<h1>空中战舰</h1>\n<p>\n铜钢铸就的巨兽，专为征服天空而生！\n四个座位，可旋转炮塔，6个武器挂载点，体型甚至超出了 Minecraft 物理引擎的预期。\n</p>\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/warship.jpg\" alt=\"Screenshot\"></p>\n<h1>组装所需物品</h1>\n<p>由于飞行器通常比船等载具更复杂，模组添加了一些专用物品，让合成过程更像是在实际组装零件。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/recipes?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=immersive_aircraft:.*&dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveAircraft/tree/1.20.1?&c=1&resolution=16&animated=False&row_width=835\" alt=\"Generated Recipes Image\"></p>\n<h1>航空器界面</h1>\n<p>升级槽位、燃料、旗帜、染料、火箭助推器和储物空间。为你的飞行器打造个性化外观！</p>\n<p><img width=\"550\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=550,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/inventory.jpg\" alt=\"Screenshot\"></p>\n<h1>丰富升级项</h1>\n<p>根据你的喜好升级和调校你的飞行器！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/atlas?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=_immersive_aircraft:upgrades&dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveAircraft/tree/1.20.1?&c=1&resolution=48&background=fancy&row_size=10\" alt=\"Generated Atlas Image\"></p>\n<p>为飞行器安装各种武器和实用模块！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/atlas?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=_immersive_aircraft:weapons&dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveAircraft/tree/1.20.1?&c=1&resolution=48&background=fancy&row_size=10\" alt=\"Generated Atlas Image\"></p>\n<h1>视频演示</h1>\n<span><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-XOlaZHOu4I?wmode=transparent\" height=\"480\" width=\"836\"></iframe></span></span>\n<h1>附加模组</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/man-of-many-planes\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Man of Many Planes&description=A set of additional aircraft for Immersive Aircraft with Create support in mind.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"多架飞机\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-machinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Machinery&description=A bunch of rustic machinery to transport, mine, and automate things.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸机械\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aviator-dreams\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Aviator Dreams&description=Real life planes from small to big.&icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1100/961/64/64/638648594348458560.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"飞行员之梦\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ia-remaining-airborne\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Remaining Airborne&description=A set of classic fighters.&icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1168/829/64/64/638739800864929977.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"凌空余烬\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/warfare-wings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Warfare Wings&description=Adds many WWII fighters in different paint designs.&icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1225/83/64/64/638802892619093611.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"战争之翼\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fia_engines\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Better Engines&description=Adds a lot of new upgrades, mostly engines, but also a turbocharger and a supercharger.&icon_url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/legoaggelos/ia_engines/refs/heads/main/common/src/main/resources/assets/more_engines/textures/item/supercharger.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"高级引擎\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/civilian-aviation\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Civilian Aviation&description=Featuring stylised real life planes and helicopters from all eras!&icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1808/958/256/256/639144393942056440.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"民用航空\">\n</a></p>\n<h1>资源包</h1>\n<p>不喜欢我的设计风格，或者希望获得更好的 Create 模组整合体验？在这里查看这些精彩的资源包吧！</p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/more-immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=More Immersive Aircraft&description=Vanilla friendly and more realistic textures for Immersive Aircraft.&icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1180/610/64/64/638753853503436917.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"更多沉浸飞行器\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-immersive-aircrafts-resource-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Create Immersive Aircrafts&description=Create-styled Immersive Aircraft resource- and datapack.&icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/849/496/64/64/638250478085753003.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Create 沉浸飞行器\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-style-modded-compats\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Create Style Compats&description=Item textures in Create style.&icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/485/413/64/64/637785634308178232.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Create 风格整合包\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/faithful-32x-immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Faithful - Immersive Aircrafts&description=FAITHFUL 32x resource pack for Immersive Aircraft.&icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/798/431/64/64/638160303843226902.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"忠实还原 - 沉浸飞行器\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-immersive-aircraft-warship\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Create IA: Warship&description=Create-styled textures for the Warship.&icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1004/277/64/64/638525212330806757.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Create IA: 空中战舰\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-immersive-aircrafts-andesite-chests-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Create Andesite Chests&description=Create-styled andesite chests for all aircraft.&icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1010/406/64/64/638534030337746940.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Create 安山木箱\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/danceboys-biplane-to-xwing\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Danceboys X-wing&description=Replaces the biplane with an x-wing!&icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1327/379/64/64/638862867702387346.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Danceboys X翼战机\">\n</a></p>\n<h1>沉浸系列</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Armors&description=A lot of unique and vanilla-faithful armor sets.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸护甲\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Aircraft&description=A bunch of rustic aircraft to travel, transport, and explore!&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸飞行器\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-melodies\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Melodies&description=Play custom melodies on various instruments and annoy your friends!&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸旋律\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Paintings&description=Drag and drop, pixelate and hang up beautiful art.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸绘画\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-optimization\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Optimization&description=A lightweight entity-tick-scheduler for doubling your TPS.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸优化\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selectivebounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=SelectiveBounds&description=Hides the ugly block selection outline when not relevant.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"选择性边界\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-furniture\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Furniture&description=Create custom and fancy furniture in-game or choose from a vast online library.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸家具\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-gateways\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Gateways&description=Mysterious, long-forgotten portals scattered across the Overworld.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸传送门\">\n</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=172ed73c9c7b23b143085297e790a860\" alt=\"用于简化页面部署的页面哈希值。\"></p>",
